{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"\u6e90\u6cc9\u5fb4\u53ce\u7a0e\u984d\uff08\u539f\u7a3f\u6599\u30fb\u8b1b\u6f14\u6599\u30fb\u30c7\u30b6\u30a4\u30f3\u6599\u306a\u3069\uff09"},"description":"Calculate Japanese withholding income tax (\u6e90\u6cc9\u5fb4\u53ce\u7a0e\u984d, including the special reconstruction surtax / from 2027 the defense surtax) on fees paid to a RESIDENT INDIVIDUAL for manuscripts, lectures, design, illustration, photos for print, translation and similar work (\u6240\u5f97\u7a0e\u6cd5 \u7b2c204\u6761\u7b2c1\u9805\u7b2c1\u53f7 fees). Formula: up to \u00a51,000,000 \u2192 10.21%; above \u2192 (amount \u2212 1,000,000) \u00d7 20.42% + 102,100; yen fractions are dropped. Use it when drafting or checking a Japanese freelance invoice or payment (\u8acb\u6c42\u66f8\u306e\u6e90\u6cc9\u5fb4\u53ce\u30fb\u624b\u53d6\u308a). Handles consumption tax shown separately on the invoice. Does NOT cover lawyers, tax accountants, judicial scriveners (\u53f8\u6cd5\u66f8\u58eb) and other item-2 professionals, sales agents (\u5916\u4ea4\u54e1), hostesses, prizes, corporations or non-residents \u2014 corporations and non-residents return an error. It does not judge whether a payment is such a fee.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"amount":{"description":"1\u56de\u306b\u6255\u3046\u5831\u916c\uff08\u5186\uff09\u3002\u6d88\u8cbb\u7a0e\u3092\u533a\u5206\u3057\u3066\u66f8\u3044\u3066\u3044\u308b\u306a\u3089\u305d\u306e\u6d88\u8cbb\u7a0e\u3092\u542b\u3081\u305f\u8acb\u6c42\u306e\u984d","maximum":1000000000000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"consumption_tax_amount":{"description":"\u8acb\u6c42\u66f8\u306b\u533a\u5206\u3057\u3066\u66f8\u3044\u305f\u6d88\u8cbb\u7a0e\u306e\u984d\uff08\u4e0a\u304c true \u306e\u6642\u3060\u3051\uff09","maximum":1000000000000,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"consumption_tax_separately_stated":{"d